  "description": "A .NET library that simplifies Azure Redis Cache integration with support for both IDistributedCache and HybridCache APIs. Features two-level caching (L1 in-memory + L2 Redis), stampede protection, structured logging, and easy DI registration.",
  "id": "DevelopmentHelpers.AzureDistributedCache",
